    "description": "Development, maintenance and support of Lyrix Mobiso speech recognition product based on SIP and VXML technologies in Linux for operation in central data center (cloud) and on-premise environments executing in physical and virtual environments.  Work includes all aspects of the product, including but not limited to web development, back-end services, software installation and upgrades, security and database design.  \n\nMaintain and support legacy Lyrix voicemail and PeopleFind products utilizing various telephony technologies and protocols globally by providing hardware, software, installation, integration and troubleshooting support for customer production systems located worldwide.\n\nIT maintenance and support for Lyrix internal systems and employees along with other personnel.",
